157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Inanimate objects like rocks are excluded. Why? Rocks do not have rationality \(although, the philosopher Zenon Pylyshyn disagrees with this, Rocks are more rational than his pet cat because they at least have to sense to go away when kicked\). )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Nonhuman animals, for similar reasons are excluded. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
