159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Therefore, one rule for participants is that they must possess reason. Surely then it is humans, right? Not really. Locke thought that children and women are incapable of rationality, therefore, they are excluded from being participants in the state. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
